@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+# TCK-19: Cluster shard count: percentages truncated
+
+In the billing sync service: Percentages for the cluster shard count are truncated to whole numbers before rounding (1 of 3 should be 33.3).
+
+Hotfix, raised during the release. Same rules as the others.
+
